{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411100","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1541110001:1":{"text":"멀린, 뭘 들고 있는 건가요?","source_cn":"梅林，拿着的是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AD753B2FDF02AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541110002:1":{"text":"이건 “돌빛”이라는 인간 마을에서 가져온 돌빛 부싯돌이에요. 에스페리아를 여행할 때 얻은 것이죠.","source_cn":"这些是生矿燧石，来自一座名为“生矿”的人类小村，是我游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B981325A8098B36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1541110003:1":{"text":"산을 끼고 세워졌기 때문에 돌빛 마을 사람들은 광석을 채굴하면서 살아요. 부싯돌은 그때 얻은 부산물이죠.","source_cn":"生矿村依山而建，以开采山体内的矿石为生。燧石是开采的副产物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AB38C9521DA2304","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1541110004:1":{"text":"“부싯돌”은... 뭔가요?","source_cn":"“燧石”……是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09972AB19C58CEF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541110005:1":{"text":"부싯돌은 불을 피울 때 사용하는 돌이에요. 2개를 서로 부딪치면 불꽃이 튄답니다.","source_cn":"燧石就是用于取火的石头。两块燧石相碰，便可以燃起火焰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDE33BE210A77CC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1541110006:1":{"text":"아쿠보르에서는 “불조각”이라 부른다고 들었어요.","source_cn":"我记得，雅库伯尔人更习惯称它为“火块”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FC8A141186A4EF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541110007:1":{"text":"아, 불조각! 알고 있어요.","source_cn":"嗯，火块。加拉知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3840780455F46E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541110008:1":{"text":"하지만 부싯돌과 불조각은 다르게 생긴 것 같아요.","source_cn":"燧石和火块，看起来不太一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC982BAFB1C89CAB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541110009:1":{"text":"돌빛 부싯돌은 깊은 산에서 나오는 것이라, 아쿠보르에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 불조각보다 순도가 높아요. 그래서 색도 더 짙지요.","source_cn":"生矿燧石源于山体深处，纯度比雅库伯尔常见的火块更高，因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87234ECB2DD6C322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541110010:1":{"text":"잘못 보관하면 불이 나기 쉬워요. 그래서 물에 담가 두었다가, 불을 피워야 할 때 꺼내서 말린 뒤에 사용하죠.","source_cn":"若是存储不当，很容易引发火势。所以最好将它浸在水中，需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE948803937199AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1541110011:1":{"text":"하지만 지금은 물에 담가 두지 않았네요.","source_cn":"可是，你没有把它泡在水里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10406B3598743B81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541110012:1":{"text":"마법사는 불이 무섭지 않나요?","source_cn":"魔法师，不怕火吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D09FE29F50C1024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541110013:1":{"text":"왜 안 무섭겠어요? 물에 담그는 것보다 마법사에게는 훨씬 더 좋은 방법이 있어서 그래요. 부싯돌에 습기 마법을 걸어두는 거예요.","source_cn":"怎么会不怕呢？只不过，比起浸泡在水中，魔法师有更好的解...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2278E464B1455AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541110014:1":{"text":"아니면 모래에 묻어두기도 하고요. 돌빛 마을에서는 이렇게 보관하곤 하죠.","source_cn":"再比如，将它们藏在沙子里——这也是生矿村的储藏方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF4C5CD0FFE0731F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541110015:1":{"text":"세상을 여행하면 무언가 배울 수 있게 되기 마련이니까요.","source_cn":"在游历世界的同时，总归需要学习一些什么，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFDC17010670021B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text"